Package: apsimwise
Title: Unified Access to the APSIMWISE Ecosystem
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bangyou", "Zheng", email = "zheng.bangyou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified interface to the APSIMWISE ecosystem of R packages 
    for crop modelling, weather analysis, and agricultural decision support.
    The package simplifies installation and loading of APSIMWISE packages 
    and exposes common user-facing functions that work consistently across
    multiple crop types.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    rapsimng (>= 0.6.0),
    rapsimng.wheat,
    rapsimng.lupin,
    rapsimng.chickpea,
    rapsimng.fababean,
    rapsimng.lentil,
    rapsimng.canola,
    tidyweather
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    dplyr,
    knitr,
    quarto,
    ggplot2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
